The C3h188 Lorentz finite dual deliberately used the gravity-preserving
current actual and therefore did not replay the already available complete
coframe/gravity synchronization.  This module closes that producer gap in
the forward action order:

```text
(proof-free source, current, contact)
→ complete synchronized gravity/matter response
→ complete P286 response and matter germs
→ Lorentz action coordinates of that same full actual family
→ canonical finite dual and auxiliary first jet.
```

The corrected coframe channel is retained explicitly.  Its torque is the
actual synchronized coframe Euler covector evaluated on the left Lorentz
coframe tangent.  Its vanishing is producer soundness of the coframe response,
not an independent Ward or Gauss-tangency theorem.

No residual, target response, inverse witness, coefficient, branch, event,
stationarity receipt, or equation certificate enters a constructor.
-/

